{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-10_end",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-10",
  "title": "一段長夢將醒",
  "storyCode": "15-11",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6eb54a0c9465584c06625da2100ba43099316eee4ec9fd215e6d7cacf31f198a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "備用電力系統還沒接通嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接線盒摔壞了。切斷那條受損的線路試試，也許短路保護開關還在工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "注意腳下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看得清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "運氣不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些源石結晶幾乎是在一瞬間冒出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是聯絡不到其他人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通訊干擾仍然存在，緊急頻道都無法正常使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我這還有一個更壞的消息，不知道為什麼，羅德島正在以極限速度向西北方向航行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣下去的話，我們很可能會與沿途的移動採礦平台發生碰撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "必須想辦法排除航道上可能會出現的意外，從外圍保護本艦，也避免把無辜的人捲進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先離開這裡，前往“壞傢伙”號的艙室確認載具設備狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "附近的空間結構已經發生變化，原本的路線圖不再可靠，務必跟緊我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（突然停下）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "牠們又來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "話音剛落，箭矢破空的聲音隨即響起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……落空了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無人回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……Stormeye？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sharp猛然回頭，身後的餐廳出口不知何時變成了一堵源石滋生的金屬牆壁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但站在他身後的，並不是Stormeye——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石結晶體",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（無聲地逼近）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這麼解決了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通訊依舊被封鎖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道其他人的情況怎麼樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pith沉默地盯著手中的通訊器，眉頭越擰越緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腳步聲遠去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而那些倒下的源石結晶體卻再度站了起來，動作完全一致地行動著，跨過了腳邊損壞的通訊裝置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殘損的通訊裝置",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——滋……所有能夠收到通訊……幹員注意……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殘損的通訊裝置",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“……不要相信……滋……通訊受阻……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殘損的通訊裝置",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“滋……羅德島……醒了……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“醒了”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "注意側方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很詭異，牠們死不透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸的袖刃彈出，指向不遠處一片浮動不定的陰影。\n重重疊疊的人影如鬼魅般浮現，從陰影中不斷湧出。每一個腳步落下時，都伴隨著結晶破碎的聲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "牠們身上的衣服——整合運動？還有食腐者……真是再見到誰都不會奇怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "牠們的身體完全由源石構成，不能用過去的經驗來判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白了，那就隨機應變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不能一直被動留在原地，要先找到這些東西的來源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們暫時無法確定這些敵人的目的。博士那邊的情況還不清楚，如果……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士那邊有阿米婭在，無需擔憂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續執行我們的任務——確定異變的根源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果這就是凱爾希一直在戒備的狀況，這些東西必然在遵循某個未知意志的指揮……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通訊也被隔離了，還是沒辦法聯絡到其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道其他的精英幹員——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "走過身旁的源石結晶時，Misery敏銳地從結晶的多個稜面中捕捉到了一個一晃而過的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我好像看到了Outcast？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀、喀——\n一隻利爪從源石結晶的表面剝離，繼而是蜷曲的犄角、嶙峋的軀幹和一根長滿尖刺的長尾。\n這樣的生物曾不只一次地出現在羅德島的作戰記錄中，但在任何記載裡，牠都並非由純粹的源石構成。\n就在這前所未見的生命形式即將邁出它的第一步時，一根冷箭貫穿了牠的咽喉，擊碎了牠的頭顱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——暫時安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stormeye靠在牆上，大口喘息了片刻，才匆忙處理起身上的傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好……不會影響戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（雜亂的噪音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sharp，Sharp，能否收到訊息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘗試留下任何可辨識的訊號，我去找你會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（雜亂的噪音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……該死——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滋——Stor……Stormeye——警惕——滋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sharp？！同步位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滋——接敵——Whitesmith——住手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……？等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石侵蝕的機械",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……援助……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "更多失控的機械造物從走廊兩側湧了出來，牠們眼中的光芒按照相同的頻率閃爍。\n牠們簡陋的發聲單元似乎突破了設計的限制，一遍遍重複著求救的呼喊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是現在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stormeye射出的箭矢精準地摧毀了兩台失控機械的核心，接著他便頭也不回地向來路奔去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少……三十個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前面的岔路口……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩條幾乎一模一樣的走廊在Stormeye眼前不斷延伸。\n羅德島內部的道路已陷入無序的變化，誰也不知道這剛剛出現的走廊分別通向怎樣的命運。\n而在他身後，那群失控的機械已經追了上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "意外比我們預估的要來得早一點，羅德島還沒有做好應對的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "面對她的話，無論什麼樣的準備都稱不上萬全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（警惕的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是顯然，她的狀態也存在某些問題，否則不應該用如此低效率的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在恐怕是我們能夠取得優勢的最後機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石結晶體",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沉默地逼近）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr，突破一條通路即可，不必戀戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "局勢很危急，必須把握時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希眼前的通路再次發生了驟變，試圖擾亂她前進的方向。\n但空間的詭變於凱爾希並無作用，她依舊能夠感知到那裡——Dr.{@nickname}的石棺。\n那是被銘刻在她底層記憶中的資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr，攔住所有靠近石棺的危險目標。我需要你幫我爭取一些時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（興奮的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她重新站到了這個熟悉的石棺之前。\n曾經，她將沉眠在其中的希望喚醒，卻最終只收穫了難以抹去的痛苦。\n此時，這也是最後的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能完全保證這能夠奏效，Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我也不會坐視渺茫的機會從我的手中溜走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希走向了石棺，她將一朵白色的花放在其上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是她遺留的饋贈，當時的她還不知道，這是從“神明”那裡盜取的火種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我們都要去挑戰那些更高的存在，才能奪來一線生機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（緊張的低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果發生了什麼意外，Mon3tr，接下來需要你自行判斷行動策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她進入了石棺之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，干擾過於嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不僅無法接收到任何訊號，這裡的環境甚至在壓制我的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得想辦法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個訊號特徵——？！PRTS？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是可露希爾嗎？怎麼可能……終端上明明依舊顯示斷線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raidian跟隨那微弱的訊號，卻定位到了完全出乎意料的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼會，你的狀態——無論你怎麼做到的，你必須——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……不，你已經不能停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道接下來該做什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……凱爾希？謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有尚能戰鬥的羅德島幹員們，我是Pith。向我匯報你們目前的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿蘭娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們還在阻止這些不斷溢出來的怪東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿蘭娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但怎麼清都清不完！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們尚無直接處理這些源石敵人的有效手段，所有策略以自保為最終目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "受傷者不准戀戰，即刻向Touch求援！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希……你又做了什麼？"
