    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "華法琳醫生，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些怪東西暫時還沒辦法傷到我。只是牠們實在太多了，要護著你們不被傷害確實有點棘手。"
