    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過按照剛剛Raidian同步的資料，這些傢伙是殺不死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“殺”……華法琳醫生，牠們……還算得上有生命嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Touch醫生和凱爾希醫生是不是也遇到了這些怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保護好你自己，我們沒你想的那麼脆弱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我真想把你們全都拆散了，看看你們到底會不會徹底死透——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛伊，閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "持續擁上來的源石結晶體不斷衝向華法琳，而就在她無暇顧及的瞬間，已經有兩個源石結晶體突破了她的防禦。\n牠們來到了克洛伊的面前，抬起了手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨後停住了。沒有攻擊，反倒像是一種邀請，邀請眼前這個幾乎快要觸及死亡的病人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石結晶體",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（寂靜地凝視）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退後！不要接觸牠們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但、但我能聽到牠在……哀嚎？那些痛苦的聲音，就像刻在我的腦子裡一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們、我們很像……很像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "克洛伊握住了源石結晶體的手，眼神中卻滿是悲傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼……你們反倒不會傷害我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……同類？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是因為你的感染？從你身上發現的那些以前我們從未見過的病徵……源石在改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——所以你的礦石病病理過程才超出了我們的預計！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……華法琳醫生，是不是這意味著我能幫你們找到對付牠們的方法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想試試，我想幫你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不希望你失望，也不想Touch醫生和凱爾希醫生受傷……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "華法琳驅逐了那個與克洛伊對視的源石結晶體，守護在這個可憐的病人身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道這個承諾意味著什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（微笑）我不清楚，但我也不害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的速度沒有你誇口的那麼快，Stormeye。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "地形變動太大，耽誤了一些時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幸好有凱爾希醫生和Raidian重建了通訊，否則很難說還會遇到什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在通訊裡提到了Whitesmith？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前一秒她還遠遠地招呼我到她的爐火前喝酒跳舞，但下一秒她就消失不見，只留下了一堆被源石污染的機械從鍛爐裡爬出來攻擊我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幻覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我分得清什麼是真，什麼是假，Stormeye。但剛剛的情況，絕對已經超過了我的認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但恐怕並不只有我遇到了這種怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石的晶簇正以肉眼可見的速度生長，他們對這些石頭本不陌生，但現在，那些晶石的稜面卻彷彿連他們的思維都要吸進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stormeye眯起眼睛，他明明看見Sharp在開口說話，但他的耳中卻聽不到一點動靜。\n一切都安靜了下來。漸漸地，連自己的心跳聲都聽不到了。\n然後，他看見Sharp臉上的表情也發生了變化。\n下一刻，所有的聲音都從羅德島上消失了，Raidian建立起的電磁通訊通道中也只剩下一片死寂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他看到了一些熟悉的身影，他們也曾情同手足……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他與曾經共同流浪的兄弟重逢了。但明明……他們早已死去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（無聲的話語）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他曾無比渴望能和這些好兄弟們有一個平靜的告別，但Stormeye此刻只感受到了憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與此同時，羅德島的另一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Misery及時推醒了阿斯卡綸，才讓她躲過了一團爆裂開的源石晶簇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "環境中的源石突兀地生長，而那些來歷不明的結晶敵人也出現得越來越頻繁，還有這些讓他們不得不分心的“幻影”——\n周圍發生的一切，都意味著這片區域正在竭盡一切將他們驅逐出去。\n“我已經定位了Abyss的大致所在”，阿斯卡綸想要將這個消息告訴Raidian……\n但源石吞噬了所有人的聲音。\n這死一般的寂靜，是一個巨大的謎，一座鉛鑄的墳墓，要將羅德島拖入無可逃避的深淵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra的聲音在羅德島全艦每個幹員的腦中響起，這是她的源石技藝。每個人都能感受到其中的力量，還有憤怒的情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是Mantra女士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她正把目前所有人收集到的情報同步給我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸和Misery已經定位到了靠近Abyss的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
